<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr loss		   $0.03   profit	   n/a</p>
<p> Net loss			12   profit	    82</p>
<p>	 (All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Company converted on July 1, 1996 to a state chartered stock savings bank from a mutual savings bank.</p>
